CM_ BO_ 54 "Orion BMS 2 cell broadcast. One frame per cell, sent round-robin at 4 ms; a full sweep of all populated cells completes in ~432 ms (108 cells x 4 ms). Byte 0 selects which cell the remaining fields describe.";
CM_ SG_ 54 BMS_Cell_ID "Zero-based cell index, used as the multiplexer for this message.";
